<title>UK: BNG sets 300 mln stg 10-year bond, 20 b.p. over.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 300 mln stg 10-year bond, 20 b.p. over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers HSBC Markets and J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    06.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.524   PAY DATE    06.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.849    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LON/AMST  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE 2007</p>
<p> NOTES	ALSO AAA FROM IBCA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
